  "code": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Relay — SaaS layout starter</title><style>\n:root{--ink:#172d39;--muted:#4c626e;--bg:#fbfcfc;--wash:#eef3f5;--accent:#15566e;--line:#b4c5cd}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:1rem/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}a{color:var(--accent);text-underline-offset:.2em}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #96501a;outline-offset:4px}.skip{position:absolute;top:-6rem;left:1rem;background:white;padding:1rem}.skip:focus{top:1rem}.wrap{width:min(72rem,100% - 2rem);margin:auto}header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:1.4rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.brand{font-weight:750;color:var(--ink);font-size:1.35rem}nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.5rem}.hero{padding:clamp(2rem,7vw,6rem) 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3rem;align-items:center}.label{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted)}h1{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5vw,4rem);letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.08;margin:.5rem 0 1.3rem;max-width:14ch}h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.2}p{max-width:55ch}.cta{background:var(--accent);color:white;display:inline-block;padding:.75rem 1.25rem;border-radius:.3rem;text-decoration:none}.mock{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:.5rem;overflow:hidden;background:white}.mock-head{background:var(--wash);padding:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.9rem}.queue{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.queue li{padding:1.1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.5rem}.queue li:last-child{border-bottom:0}.queue small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}.status{align-self:start;border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.75rem;padding:.15rem .45rem;border-radius:1rem}.note{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted)}.workflow{padding:2rem 0 3rem;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.steps{padding:0;list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2rem;counter-reset:step}.steps li{counter-increment:step;border-top:2px solid var(--accent);padding-top:1rem}.steps li:before{content:'0' counter(step);color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}.steps h3{margin:.5rem 0}.steps p{margin:0}.faq{padding:2rem 0;max-width:50rem}details{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:1rem 0}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;padding:.25rem}footer{padding:2rem 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem}@media(max-width:48rem){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.5rem}.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.5rem}h1{max-width:20ch}.queue li{grid-template-columns:1fr}.status{justify-self:start}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}\n</style></head><body><a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a><div class=\"wrap\"><header><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#main\">Relay /</a><nav aria-label=\"Primary\"><a href=\"#workflow\">Workflow</a><a href=\"#questions\">Questions</a></nav></header><main id=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\"><section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"title\"><div><p class=\"label\">Original product-page starter</p><h1 id=\"title\">A clearer handoff, one task at a time.</h1><p>Show how a work queue could help a small team describe the next action, record a decision, and know what is waiting.</p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"#workflow\">See the sample workflow</a><p class=\"note\">Concept only. No customer counts, endorsements, or performance promises.</p></div><section class=\"mock\" aria-label=\"Static interface preview\"><div class=\"mock-head\">Example queue · illustration, not a live workspace</div><ul class=\"queue\"><li><div>Review the draft outline<small>Next action: add context to the introduction.</small></div><span class=\"status\">Ready for review</span></li><li><div>Choose the release notes format<small>Next action: compare two short options.</small></div><span class=\"status\">Decision needed</span></li><li><div>Document the handoff<small>Next action: list the open questions.</small></div><span class=\"status\">In progress</span></li></ul></section></section><section class=\"workflow\" id=\"workflow\" aria-labelledby=\"workflow-title\"><h2 id=\"workflow-title\">Keep the structure simple.</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Describe the work</h3><p>Write an outcome and one useful next step, rather than another vague status label.</p></li><li><h3>Make a decision visible</h3><p>Put the reasoning beside the task so the next reader does not need to reconstruct it.</p></li><li><h3>Close the loop</h3><p>Leave a short handoff note explaining what changed and what still needs attention.</p></li></ol></section><section class=\"faq\" id=\"questions\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\"><h2 id=\"faq-title\">Before you adapt it</h2><details><summary>Does this include a working product?</summary><p>No. This is a static landing-page starter. The queue is a visual example; authentication, storage, billing, and collaboration are not implemented.</p></details><details><summary>Where should real evidence go?</summary><p>Replace the explanatory copy with accurate capabilities. Add customer quotes or measured results only when you have permission and verifiable evidence.</p></details></section></main><footer>Original demo copy · system fonts · no network requests.</footer></div></body></html>"
}
